# Borrowed assets.
#
# Nothing is borrowed and nothing can be: assets from an escrowed resource are encrypted and
# make FiveM refuse to load this one. The patterns stay so a copy made in haste is not also
# committed. See ASSET-001 in docs/internal/TASKS.md.
stream/w_am_hose.*
data/*.meta
